@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ito-il26-nouns`

-- What the employee may claim: regulation 2 (the employee's card) and regulation 9 (reductions and
-- exemptions), with regulation 10 (coordination), of the Income Tax (Deduction from Salary and Wages)
-- Regulations 5753-1993.
--
-- Source: ../../registers/source-bundle/regulations/income-tax-deduction-from-salary-and-wages-regulations-5753-1993.he.wiki.txt
-- (sha256 e6fd6975...b7b20f). Regulation 2 is lines 45-52, regulation 9 is lines 107-130, regulation 10 is 132-133.
--
-- The credit points claimed on the card are a number the employee gives (see the nouns); which points an
-- employee is entitled to is ss 33A to 40D and 66(c) of the Ordinance (rows IL-01, IL-02 and IL-08). The
-- grounds of regulation 9(a) are requests to the assessing officer, whose direction is an input of
-- ito-il26-regulations.l4 (`A direction of the assessing officer`). The Director may tell employers generally
-- to allow them without the officer (the last sentence of regulation 9(a)), which is not a figure.

§ `Regulations 2 and 9 — what the employee declares and may claim`

§§ `Regulation 2 — the employee's card`

-- src:46 | (א) עובד למעט עובד יומי ולמעט עובד זר, חייב למלא בכרטיס העובד (טופס 0101) את כל הפרטים במועדים אלה:
-- src:50 | (ג) מעביד חייב לדרוש כרטיס עובד מכל עובד שאינו עובד יומי או עובד זר, במועדים המפורטים בתקנת משנה (א).
-- src:51 | (ד) חל שינוי באחד הפרטים המפורטים בכרטיס העובד (טופס 0101), חייב העובד להודיע על כך למעבידו תוך שבוע ימים מתאריך השינוי.
@ref Regulations 5753-1993, reg 2(a), (c) (source lines 46, 50)
GIVEN `the payment` IS A `A payment of salary`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the employer must demand an employee's card for` `the payment` MEANS
    -- not a day employee and not a foreign worker (reg 2(a), (c)); a day employee is a person with fewer than
    -- 18 days in the month and at least 8 hours a week (reg 1), a foreign worker the payment's own flag.
    NOT (`the payment`'s `the employee is a foreign worker`
         OR (`the payment`'s `days worked in the month` LESS THAN 18 AND `the payment`'s `hours worked a week` AT LEAST 8))

§§ `Regulation 9(a) — the grounds of a request`

-- src:108 | (א) פקיד השומה רשאי, על פי בקשת העובד, להורות למעביד להקטין את ניכוי המס או להימנע מניכוי מס כאשר לעובד מגיע ניכוי, זיכוי או נקודת זיכוי, או כאשר הכנסתו פטורה ממס כולה או מקצתה לרבות –
@ref Regulations 5753-1993, reg 9(a) (source lines 108-127)
GIVEN g IS A `A ground for asking the assessing officer to reduce the deduction`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the paragraph of regulation 9(a) for` g MEANS
    CONSIDER g
    WHEN `blindness, or a disability of 100% or of 90% on the special computation (section 9(5))` THEN 1
    WHEN `residence in a settlement or area given a benefit (sections 11, 11A, 11B or another law)` THEN 3
    WHEN `being a new immigrant (section 35)` THEN 4
    WHEN `marriage within the tax year (section 37)` THEN 5
    WHEN `the work of an unregistered spouse (section 38), if a separate computation was not asked for` THEN 6
    WHEN `maintenance paid to a former spouse after marrying another (section 40A)` THEN 7
    WHEN `donations above the adjusted amount (section 46)` THEN 8
    WHEN `the cost of keeping a relative in an institution (section 44)` THEN 9
    WHEN `dependants without means (section 45)` THEN 10
    WHEN `payments under section 45A or 47, or section 4 of the Income Tax Ordinance Amendment (No. 2) Law 5722-1962` THEN 11
    WHEN `the birth of a child within the tax year, for a female employee (sections 40(b)(1) or 66(c)(3))` THEN 12
    WHEN `a spouse of 16 but not 18 whom the employee supports (section 40B)` THEN 13
    WHEN `payments for parallel tax or medical insurance (section 47A)` THEN 14
    WHEN `credit points not given for want of income in part of the tax year` THEN 15
    WHEN `the credit points of a discharged soldier (section 39A)` THEN 16
    WHEN `credit points under section 40C or 40D` THEN 17
    WHEN `membership or handling fees (Income Tax (Deduction of Certain Expenses) Regulations 5732-1972)` THEN 18
    WHEN `professional liability insurance paid through the employer under a collective agreement` THEN 19

-- The text lets the assessing officer, at the employee's request, direct the employer to reduce the deduction
-- or not to deduct. It does not oblige the officer; "may" is the officer's.
@ref Regulations 5753-1993, reg 9(a) (source line 108)
GIVEN g IS A `A ground for asking the assessing officer to reduce the deduction`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the employee may ask the assessing officer to reduce the deduction on the ground` g MEANS
    TRUE

§§ `Regulation 9(c) — the exempt part of a pension`

-- src:130 | (ג) מעביד המשלם לעובד קיצבה אשר חלק ממנה פטור ממס, לפי סעיפים 9א או 9ב לפקודה, לא ינכה מס מהחלק הפטור מהקיצבה שהוא משלם.
@ref Regulations 5753-1993, reg 9(c) (source line 130)
GIVEN `the pension paid`       IS A NUMBER
      `the part exempt under section 9A or 9B` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the part of a pension of` `the pension paid` `from which tax is deducted, the part exempt under section 9A or 9B being` `the part exempt under section 9A or 9B` MEANS
    IF   `the part exempt under section 9A or 9B` GREATER THAN `the pension paid`
    THEN REFUSE "the exempt part of a pension exceeds the pension paid"
    ELSE `the pension paid` MINUS `the part exempt under section 9A or 9B`
